{"5040600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Relaxation Massage Studio", "steam_appid": 5040600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxation Massage Studio is a laid-back and charming management sim that lets you run your very own massage studio. With thousands of appearance options and hundreds of ready-made presets to choose from, you can customize your favorite looks and set them as your assistant or customers — then interact with them right inside your studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/d6bef9ef0c38b512230ccedd392f3c84.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/d6bef9ef0c38b512230ccedd392f3c84.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/921cd2e2df8307d733fed1d56cd2be48.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/921cd2e2df8307d733fed1d56cd2be48.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/d02455e1baa52a3de942a696ebe2f828.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/d02455e1baa52a3de942a696ebe2f828.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a detailed massage simulation. Customers come in to relieve their stress and fatigue, and it's up to you to use a variety of massage techniques to serve them well and win their Affection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/e911ed7b3fed4aaea8478eabb3170c7e.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/e911ed7b3fed4aaea8478eabb3170c7e.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/11df22a50082f3142c33fc209ef2aaa0.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/11df22a50082f3142c33fc209ef2aaa0.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/db2caf37b2a6d658a8d5a051355745b7.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/db2caf37b2a6d658a8d5a051355745b7.webp?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the massage itself, the real challenge lies in striking a balance between customer flow, business efficiency, and managing your funds. If you're not careful with your finances, you might even risk having to close up shop. But knowing you, you'll take that little studio and turn it into something truly special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/146bc367236cbc90aff1253b53dc099f.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/146bc367236cbc90aff1253b53dc099f.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/1fc910a7cb26d2e25ba69757c8885adf.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/1fc910a7cb26d2e25ba69757c8885adf.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/684138373f3af8f12ec99f5bce42dc4c.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/684138373f3af8f12ec99f5bce42dc4c.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your studio grows, you'll be able to hire more staff, renovate with more stylish decor, unlock advanced treatments, and serve an ever-wider range of clients. Above all, we hope you'll find joy not only in building up your business, but also in spending relaxing, heartwarming moments together with everyone at the studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxation Massage Studio is a laid-back and charming management sim that lets you run your very own massage studio. With thousands of appearance options and hundreds of ready-made presets to choose from, you can customize your favorite looks and set them as your assistant or customers — then interact with them right inside your studio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras/d6bef9ef0c38b512230ccedd392f3c84.avif?t=1786082242\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5040600/extras_big/d6bef9ef0c38b512230ccedd392f3c84.avif?t=1786082242 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\